      "statement": "Adds the Sync Control Plane v0.2 independent-approval migration (SECURITY DEFINER activation guard delegating to a SECURITY INVOKER rule function, service_role EXECUTE grant), its SQL guard cases and drivers, the database-guard CI job and its static checks, Deck Grammar content-hash binding, and regenerated conformance artifacts with the documents that quote their digests. Observed on this tree: 203 unit tests pass, both conformance validators exit 0 with tracked artifacts unchanged, and on a throwaway PostgreSQL 16 cluster all migrations apply and both guard-case drivers exit 0 leaving no rows. Not established: behavior on a managed Supabase project, the Supabase linter, the approval trust root and content-hash preimage (open briefs), that database-guard is a required check, and merge approval.",
